review:
Guildrun Demo
pros:
//fast game with modern day graphics with easy controls that moves from location A to B to C and so on
//good amount of action and special effects
cons:
//some difficult battles/boss battles
//some overpowered enemies
//could use more powerups and loot
//requires some micromanagement
//somewhat repetitive

//good game
Personal Suggested Purchase Price: Free To Play
extra notes:
//you are a team of rpg rogue heroes autobattling instances of magical rpg enemies
//defeat enemies, recruit heroes onto your team, equip and upgrade your heroes and get stronger
//some surprising power moves and variety of unique relics that will keep you interested
